 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 4.76,
   "text": "Hi everyone, welcome to another tutorial where we break engraving down into simple steps"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.76,
   "end": 5.84,
   "text": "anyone can follow."
  },
  {
   "start": 6.16,
   "end": 10.04,
   "text": "Today we're stepping into one of the most satisfying materials to engrave on, glass."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.26,
   "end": 14.62,
   "text": "People always ask me things like, isn't glass too slippery, what if it cracks?"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.98,
   "end": 18.0,
   "text": "And I get it, it looks a little intimidating at first."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.18,
   "end": 23.08,
   "text": "But the truth is, with a low speed and the right bit and a calm pace, glass becomes"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.08,
   "end": 24.72,
   "text": "surprisingly beginner friendly."
  },
  {
   "start": 25.1,
   "end": 27.5,
   "text": "So let's start with something simple and build from there."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.5,
   "end": 32.1,
   "text": "Before we start, we need to talk about safety, because glass is one of those materials that"
  },
  {
   "start": 32.1,
   "end": 33.58,
   "text": "requires the most care."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.78,
   "end": 37.74,
   "text": "Make sure you're wearing safety glasses and a mask, glass creates a very fine dust"
  },
  {
   "start": 37.74,
   "end": 39.3,
   "text": "that you do not want to breathe in."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.42,
   "end": 43.82,
   "text": "And for the same reason, work in a well ventilated space and keep your surface clean"
  },
  {
   "start": 43.82,
   "end": 44.5,
   "text": "and stable."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.94,
   "end": 46.64,
   "text": "First piece, this glass jar."
  },
  {
   "start": 46.86,
   "end": 49.56,
   "text": "I'm using one of the mandala stencils from Cliente A."
  },
  {
   "start": 49.58,
   "end": 53.48,
   "text": "These work especially well on glass because they give you a clear structure to follow."
  },
  {
   "start": 53.62,
   "end": 57.48,
   "text": "Place the stencil on the outside of the jar and hold it in place with a couple pieces"
  },
  {
   "start": 57.48,
   "end": 57.92,
   "text": "of tape."
  },
  {
   "start": 57.98,
   "end": 62.44,
   "text": "Since the surface is curved, you might have to adjust it a bit until it sits flat."
  },
  {
   "start": 62.62,
   "end": 67.16,
   "text": "Once it's stable, trace the design lightly with a marker, just enough so you can follow"
  },
  {
   "start": 67.16,
   "end": 69.24,
   "text": "the lines once the stencil is off."
  },
  {
   "start": 69.4,
   "end": 70.94,
   "text": "Now let's talk about bits."
  },
  {
   "start": 71.14,
   "end": 74.56,
   "text": "For glass, I recommend using either a ball bit or a square bit."
  },
  {
   "start": 74.72,
   "end": 78.82,
   "text": "The ball bit gives smooth, rounded strokes and it's great for beginners."
  },
  {
   "start": 79.1,
   "end": 83.64,
   "text": "The square bit creates more defined lines when used at an angle, especially for"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.64,
   "end": 85.98,
   "text": "geometric shapes like this mandala."
  },
  {
   "start": 85.98,
   "end": 87.76,
   "text": "Get your Engraver Pro to speed one."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.92,
   "end": 91.3,
   "text": "When you start engraving, use very light pressure and short strokes."
  },
  {
   "start": 91.52,
   "end": 95.5,
   "text": "This material doesn't like rushed movements, so work slowly through the design."
  },
  {
   "start": 95.82,
   "end": 97.72,
   "text": "And don't forget to wipe the dust away often."
  },
  {
   "start": 97.88,
   "end": 101.9,
   "text": "It helps you keep track of your lines and makes the whole process much safer."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.34,
   "end": 102.84,
   "text": "That's it!"
  },
  {
   "start": 103.1,
   "end": 104.2,
   "text": "It turned out beautiful, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 104.42,
   "end": 108.26,
   "text": "It's such a simple project, but it gives the jar a completely new purpose."
  },
  {
   "start": 108.52,
   "end": 110.42,
   "text": "So let's try something perfect for gifting."
  },
  {
   "start": 110.54,
   "end": 111.8,
   "text": "A glass perfume bottle."
  },
  {
   "start": 111.94,
   "end": 115.78,
   "text": "I'm engraving the phrase, Happy Birthday, because my mother's birthday is next week"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.78,
   "end": 117.6,
   "text": "and I'm sure she will love this."
  },
  {
   "start": 117.94,
   "end": 121.3,
   "text": "A ball bit on low speed, keeping my strokes short and gentle."
  },
  {
   "start": 121.6,
   "end": 125.08,
   "text": "Lettering on glass feels a little slippery at first, but once you follow"
  },
  {
   "start": 125.08,
   "end": 128.0,
   "text": "the guide of the marker lines, it becomes really steady."
  },
  {
   "start": 128.4,
   "end": 132.3,
   "text": "After engraving, I'm adding a touch of gold patina to make the letter stand out."
  },
  {
   "start": 132.44,
   "end": 136.22,
   "text": "It settles inside the grooves and gives the whole piece a really elegant look."
  },
  {
   "start": 136.32,
   "end": 139.28,
   "text": "I think I just made the perfect customized gift ever."
  },
  {
   "start": 139.5,
   "end": 142.58,
   "text": "And for our last idea, let's move into something really festive."
  },
  {
   "start": 142.72,
   "end": 144.48,
   "text": "Once you're comfortable using the Engraver Pro,"
  },
  {
   "start": 144.48,
   "end": 148.18,
   "text": "pieces like this become such a fun way to decorate your home for the holidays."
  },
  {
   "start": 148.6,
   "end": 151.64,
   "text": "I'm engraving a simple snowflake using a ball bit on high speed."
  },
  {
   "start": 152.0,
   "end": 153.84,
   "text": "You don't need a perfect outline for this one."
  },
  {
   "start": 154.2,
   "end": 157.6,
   "text": "Holiday designs look even cozier when they have that slightly handmade look."
  },
  {
   "start": 158.06,
   "end": 161.44,
   "text": "Little details like this around your home make the season feel so much warmer"
  },
  {
   "start": 161.44,
   "end": 164.1,
   "text": "and the Engraver Pro makes it super easy to create them."
  },
  {
   "start": 164.38,
   "end": 165.04,
   "text": "Cheers to that!"
  },
  {
   "start": 165.5,
   "end": 167.44,
   "text": "And here are our three finished pieces."
  },
  {
   "start": 167.92,
   "end": 171.46,
   "text": "Glass has this beautiful frosted effect when you engrave on it."
  },
  {
   "start": 171.46,
   "end": 175.36,
   "text": "Once you get the basics, you can transform so many everyday objects."
  },
  {
   "start": 175.62,
   "end": 181.82,
   "text": "Jars, bottles, mirrors, candle holders, even recycled pieces look completely new."
  },
  {
   "start": 182.18,
   "end": 185.74,
   "text": "Now that you know all this, glass doesn't feel so intimidating anymore, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 186.04,
   "end": 187.98,
   "text": "Comment what surface you'd like us to engrave next"
  },
  {
   "start": 187.98,
   "end": 191.34,
   "text": "and click the subscribe button to keep leveling up your DIY projects."
  },
  {
   "start": 191.76,
   "end": 192.62,
   "text": "See you in the next one!"
  }
 ],
